<title>SPAIN: Spain probes Koipe for share price manipulation.</title>
<headline>Spain probes Koipe for share price manipulation.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's CNMV stock market commission said on Wednesday that it had launched a probe into olive oil producer Koipe for suspected manipulation of its share price.</p>
<p>&quot;The probe...refers to practices designed to manipulate the price of its own shares,&quot; the CNMV said in a statement.</p>
<p>It characterised the infraction as &quot;very grave.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-8341</p>
